2026-09-27T10:00:32.6237958Z Description:
2026-09-27T10:00:32.6238584Z This PPA contains more recent Python versions packaged for Ubuntu.
2026-09-27T10:00:32.6239103Z 
2026-09-27T10:00:32.6240351Z Disclaimer: there's no guarantee of timely updates in case of security problems or other issues. If you want to use them in a security-or-otherwise-critical environment (say, on a production server), you do so at your own risk.
2026-09-27T10:00:32.6241832Z 
2026-09-27T10:00:32.6241979Z Update Note
2026-09-27T10:00:32.6242375Z ===========
2026-09-27T10:00:32.6242922Z Please use this repository instead of ppa:fkrull/deadsnakes.
2026-09-27T10:00:32.6243359Z 
2026-09-27T10:00:32.6243550Z Reporting Issues
2026-09-27T10:00:32.6243952Z ================
2026-09-27T10:00:32.6244183Z 
2026-09-27T10:00:32.6244486Z Issues can be reported in the master issue tracker at:
2026-09-27T10:00:32.6245153Z https://github.com/deadsnakes/issues/issues
2026-09-27T10:00:32.6245513Z 
2026-09-27T10:00:32.6245727Z Supported Ubuntu and Python Versions
2026-09-27T10:00:32.6246360Z ====================================
2026-09-27T10:00:32.6246675Z 
2026-09-27T10:00:32.6246917Z - Ubuntu 22.04 (jammy) Python3.7+ (NOT Python3.10)
2026-09-27T10:00:32.6247677Z - Ubuntu 24.04 (noble) Python3.7+ (NOT Python3.12)
2026-09-27T10:00:32.6248281Z - Ubuntu 26.04 (resolute) Python3.7+ (NOT Python3.14)
2026-09-27T10:00:32.6249383Z - Note: Python 3.10 (jammy), Python3.12 (noble), Python3.14 (resolute) are not provided by deadsnakes as upstream ubuntu provides those packages.
2026-09-27T10:00:32.6250260Z 
2026-09-27T10:00:32.6250468Z Why some packages aren't built:
2026-09-27T10:00:32.6251161Z - Note: for 22.04+, older python versions requre libssl<3 so they are not currently built
2026-09-27T10:00:32.6252054Z - If you need these, reach out to asottile to set up a private ppa
2026-09-27T10:00:32.6252551Z 
2026-09-27T10:00:32.6253034Z The packages may also work on other versions of Ubuntu or Debian, but that is not tested or supported.
2026-09-27T10:00:32.6253715Z 
2026-09-27T10:00:32.6253906Z Packages
2026-09-27T10:00:32.6254275Z ========
2026-09-27T10:00:32.6254465Z 
2026-09-27T10:00:32.6256850Z The packages provided here are loosely based on the debian upstream packages with some modifications to make them more usable as non-default pythons and on ubuntu.  As such, the packages follow debian's patterns and often do not include a full python distribution with just `apt install python#.#`.  Here is a list of packages that may be useful along with the default install:
2026-09-27T10:00:32.6259701Z 
2026-09-27T10:00:32.6260122Z - `python#.#-dev`: includes development headers for building C extensions
2026-09-27T10:00:32.6260911Z - `python#.#-venv`: provides the standard library `venv` module
2026-09-27T10:00:32.6262114Z - `python#.#-distutils`: provides the standard library `distutils` module
2026-09-27T10:00:32.6263095Z - `python#.#-lib2to3`: provides the `2to3-#.#` utility as well as the standard library `lib2to3` module
2026-09-27T10:00:32.6264019Z - `python#.#-gdbm`: provides the standard library `dbm.gnu` module
2026-09-27T10:00:32.6264804Z - `python#.#-tk`: provides the standard library `tkinter` module
2026-09-27T10:00:32.6265428Z 
2026-09-27T10:00:32.6265601Z Third-Party Python Modules
2026-09-27T10:00:32.6266019Z ==========================
2026-09-27T10:00:32.6266481Z 
2026-09-27T10:00:32.6268586Z Python modules in the official Ubuntu repositories are packaged to work with the Python interpreters from the official repositories. Accordingly, they generally won't work with the Python interpreters from this PPA. As an exception, pure-Python modules for Python 3 will work, but any compiled extension modules won't.
2026-09-27T10:00:32.6270489Z 
2026-09-27T10:00:32.6271624Z To install 3rd-party Python modules, you should use the common Python packaging tools.  For an introduction into the Python packaging ecosystem and its tools, refer to the Python Packaging User Guide:
2026-09-27T10:00:32.6273147Z https://packaging.python.org/installing/
2026-09-27T10:00:32.6273531Z 
2026-09-27T10:00:32.6273681Z Sources
2026-09-27T10:00:32.6274023Z =======
2026-09-27T10:00:32.6274475Z The package sources are available at:
2026-09-27T10:00:32.6275043Z https://github.com/deadsnakes/
2026-09-27T10:00:32.6275345Z 
